<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AI Operating System</title>
<meta name="description" content="A permanent knowledge base for discovering, comparing, and building with AI tools.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --dark:#141413;
    --light:#faf9f5;
    --mid-gray:#b0aea5;
    --light-gray:#e8e6dc;
    --orange:#d97757;
    --blue:#6a9bcc;
    --green:#788c5d;
    --slate-900:#1c1c1a;
    --slate-800:#242422;
    --border:rgba(232,230,220,0.14);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--dark);
    color:var(--light);
    font-family:'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.display{ font-family:'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif; }
  a{ color:inherit; }
  button{ font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer; border:none; }
  input, select{ font-family:inherit; }
  ::selection{ background:var(--orange); color:var(--dark); }
  :focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--orange); outline-offset:2px; }

  .wrap{ max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  #hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    overflow:hidden;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .glow{
    position:absolute;
    width:520px; height:520px;
    border-radius:50%;
    filter:blur(120px);
    opacity:0.28;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .glow.o{ background:var(--orange); top:8%; left:6%; }
  .glow.b{ background:var(--blue); bottom:6%; right:6%; }
  .hero-inner{ position:relative; z-index:2; max-width:760px; padding:0 24px; }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:8px 18px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:rgba(217,119,87,0.14);
    color:var(--orange);
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    margin-bottom:28px;
    font-family:'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .hero-title{
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    font-weight:700;
    line-height:1.05;
    letter-spacing:-0.02em;
    margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    color:var(--mid-gray);
    font-size:clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
    max-width:560px;
    margin:0 auto 44px;
  }
  .cta{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    background:var(--orange);
    color:var(--dark);
    font-family:'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:16px;
    padding:15px 30px;
    border-radius:10px;
    transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
  }
  .cta:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(217,119,87,0.35); }

  .phase-dots{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-top:64px;
  }
  .phase-dot{
    padding:10px 14px;
    border-radius:9px;
    background:var(--slate-800);
    color:var(--mid-gray);
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    transition:background .2s, color .2s;
  }
  .phase-dot:hover{ background:#2c2c29; }

  /* ---------- HEADER ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(20,20,19,0.9);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    display:none;
  }
  header.show{ display:block; }
  .header-top{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    padding:20px 0 16px;
  }
  .brand-btn{
    background:none; color:var(--light);
    font-family:'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight:700; font-size:20px;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    transition:opacity .2s;
  }
  .brand-btn:hover{ opacity:0.7; }
  .compare-btn{
    background:var(--orange); color:var(--dark);
    font-weight:600; font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    padding:9px 16px; border-radius:8px; font-size:14px;
  }

  .controls{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-bottom:14px; }
  @media (max-width:640px){ .controls{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .search-box{ position:relative; }
  .search-box svg{ position:absolute; left:12px; top:11px; opacity:0.5; }
  .search-box input{
    width:100%; padding:10px 14px 10px 38px;
    background:var(--slate-900); border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:8px; color:var(--light); font-size:14px;
  }
  select{
    padding:10px 14px; background:var(--slate-900);
    border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;
    color:var(--light); font-size:14px;
  }

  .phase-nav{
    display:flex; gap:8px; overflow-x:auto; padding-bottom:18px;
    scrollbar-width:thin;
  }
  .phase-nav::-webkit-scrollbar{ height:4px; }
  .phase-nav::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{ background:var(--border); border-radius:4px; }
  .phase-btn{
    white-space:nowrap; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:8px;
    background:var(--slate-800); color:var(--mid-gray);
    font-weight:600; font-size:13.5px; transition:background .2s,color .2s;
  }
  .phase-btn.active{ background:var(--orange); color:var(--dark); }
  .phase-btn:hover:not(.active){ background:#2c2c29; }

  /* ---------- SECTIONS ---------- */
  main{ padding:56px 0 100px; }
  .section{ display:none; }
  .section.active{ display:block; animation:fadein .35s ease; }
  @keyframes fadein{ from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px);} to{opacity:1; transform:none;} }

  .badge{
    display:inline-block; padding:7px 16px; border-radius:999px;
    font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.12em;
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif; margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .badge.orange{ background:rgba(217,119,87,.16); color:var(--orange); }
  .badge.blue{ background:rgba(106,155,204,.16); color:var(--blue); }
  .badge.green{ background:rgba(120,140,93,.16); color:var(--green); }

  .section h2{ font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem); margin-bottom:12px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
  .section .lede{ color:var(--mid-gray); font-size:17px; max-width:640px; margin-bottom:40px; }

  .grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px,1fr)); gap:20px; }
  .grid-2{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr); gap:24px; }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .grid-2{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  .card{
    background:var(--slate-800); border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px; padding:22px; transition:border-color .2s;
  }
  .card:hover{ border-color:rgba(232,230,220,0.3); }
  .card h3{ font-size:17px; margin-bottom:2px; }
  .muted{ color:var(--mid-gray); }
  .small{ font-size:13.5px; }

  .card ul{ list-style:none; }
  .card li{ margin-bottom:8px; display:flex; gap:8px; color:var(--light-gray); font-size:14.5px; }
  .arrow{ color:var(--orange); flex-shrink:0; }

  /* Tool cards */
  .tool-card{ position:relative; }
  .fav-btn{ background:none; color:var(--mid-gray); font-size:18px; line-height:1; padding:2px; }
  .fav-btn.active{ color:var(--orange); }
  .tool-head{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .kv{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:13.5px; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .kv span:first-child{ color:var(--mid-gray); }
  .score{ font-weight:700; color:var(--orange); }
  .tags{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin:12px 0 14px; }
  .tag{ font-size:11.5px; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(217,119,87,.14); color:var(--orange); font-weight:600; }
  .cmp-btn{ width:100%; padding:9px; border-radius:7px; background:rgba(106,155,204,.18); color:var(--blue); font-weight:700; font-size:13.5px; }
  .cmp-btn:hover{ background:rgba(106,155,204,.3); }
  .cmp-btn:disabled{ opacity:0.4; cursor:default; }

  .results-count{ color:var(--mid-gray); font-size:13.5px; margin-bottom:18px; }

  /* Comparison table */
  .cmp-wrap{ overflow-x:auto; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; }
  table{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:14px; }
  th,td{ padding:14px 16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); text-align:left; white-space:nowrap; }
  th{ background:var(--slate-900); font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif; font-size:13px; }
  .cmp-chips{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-top:16px; }
  .chip{ background:var(--slate-800); padding:6px 12px; border-radius:999px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; }
  .chip button{ background:none; color:var(--mid-gray); font-size:15px; }
  .chip button:hover{ color:var(--orange); }
  .empty{ padding:60px 24px; text-align:center; color:var(--mid-gray); border:1px dashed var(--border); border-radius:12px; }

  /* Opportunities */
  .opp-row{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr auto; gap:20px;
    align-items:center; padding:22px; background:var(--slate-800);
    border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .opp-row{ grid-template-columns:1fr; text-align:left; } }
  .opp-score{ text-align:center; }
  .opp-score .num{ font-size:28px; font-weight:700; color:var(--orange); font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif; }
  .opp-score .lbl{ font-size:11px; color:var(--mid-gray); }
  .stat-label{ font-size:12px; color:var(--mid-gray); margin-bottom:2px; }
  .stat-val{ font-weight:700; }

  footer{ border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding:32px 0; text-align:center; color:var(--mid-gray); font-size:13px; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }
    html{ scroll-behavior:auto; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero">
  <div class="glow o"></div>
  <div class="glow b"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">COMPREHENSIVE AI INTELLIGENCE</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Your AI<br>Operating<br>System</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">A permanent knowledge base for discovering, evaluating, and building with AI tools — 10 phases of research, comparison, and personal recommendations.</p>
    <button class="cta" onclick="goPhase('phase0')">
      Begin Exploration
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="phase-dots" id="heroDots"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HEADER (shown once a phase is active) -->
<header id="siteHeader">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="header-top">
      <button class="brand-btn" onclick="goPhase('hero')">AI OS</button>
      <button class="compare-btn" id="compareToggle" style="display:none" onclick="toggleComparisonView()">Compare (<span id="cmpCount">0</span>)</button>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
      <div class="search-box">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
        <input id="searchInput" type="text" placeholder="Search tools..." oninput="renderTools()">
      </div>
      <select id="categorySelect" onchange="renderTools()"></select>
    </div>
    <nav class="phase-nav" id="phaseNav"></nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">

  <!-- PHASE 0 -->
  <section class="section" id="phase0">
    <span class="badge orange">PHASE 0</span>
    <h2>Research Foundation</h2>
    <p class="lede">Establish the framework for comprehensive AI ecosystem analysis.</p>
    <div class="grid-2" id="phase0Grid"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHASE 2 -->
  <section class="section" id="phase2">
    <span class="badge blue">PHASE 2</span>
    <h2>Complete AI Tools Database</h2>
    <p class="lede">Searchable, filterable, and comparable — the core of the system.</p>
    <div class="results-count" id="resultsCount"></div>
    <div class="grid" id="toolsGrid"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHASE 4: Comparison -->
  <section class="section" id="phase4">
    <span class="badge blue">PHASE 4</span>
    <h2>Competitive Matrix</h2>
    <p class="lede">Add tools from the database (Phase 2) to compare them side by side — up to 4 at once.</p>
    <div id="comparisonArea"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHASE 5 -->
  <section class="section" id="phase5">
    <span class="badge green">PHASE 5</span>
    <h2>Workflow Engineering</h2>
    <p class="lede">Optimized tool combinations for real-world personas.</p>
    <div class="grid-2" id="stacksGrid"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHASE 6 -->
  <section class="section" id="phase6">
    <span class="badge orange">PHASE 6</span>
    <h2>Business Opportunities</h2>
    <p class="lede">High-impact gaps in the AI ecosystem, ranked by opportunity score.</p>
    <div id="oppList"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHASE 9 -->
  <section class="section" id="phase9">
    <span class="badge blue">PHASE 9</span>
    <h2>Future of AI</h2>
    <p class="lede">Predictions across timeframes.</p>
    <div class="grid" id="trendsGrid"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHASE 10 -->
  <section class="section" id="phase10">
    <span class="badge green">PHASE 10</span>
    <h2>Personal Recommendations</h2>
    <p class="lede">Your customized AI toolkit — edit the data in the script to make this yours.</p>
    <div class="grid-2" id="recsGrid"></div>
  </section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">Built with the AI Operating System master prompt · Edit the data arrays in <code>index.html</code> to keep this current</div>
</footer>

<script>
/* =========================================================
   DATA — edit these arrays to grow your AI Operating System
   ========================================================= */

